  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide an effective response and meet immediate humanitarian needs in the wake of Hurricanes Irma and Maria in the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity To provide an effective response and meet immediate humanitarian needs in the wake of Hurricanes Irma and Maria in the Caribbean is a component of Humanitarian Response to Hurricanes Irma and Maria in the Caribbean reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;9,000,000. This project benefits Caribbean, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services.</narrative>
  </description>
